t(1, 200, """Let us look ahead together to understand what is coming .. Understanding is drawn as a hope in Allah Most High alone, and from certainty the decrees come, in the measure of its firmness, by the will of the Lord

In the New Testament .. "For if a woman does not cover herself, let her cut her hair. But if it is a disgrace for a woman to cut or shave her hair, she should cover herself." And also: "For this reason a woman ought to have authority over her head, because of the angels."

And in the kingdom of Jerusalem everyone is under the word of Allah .. So let no woman of the Gospel say: I do not acknowledge my religion .. For whoever does not acknowledge his religion, why does he remain in it? A month ago one of the sisters wrote here, perhaps a Jerusalemite, objecting to my conception and my foresight of what is coming, and said: But in Palestine there are Christian women, and it is their right to live as they wish because it is their country! So I wrote to her: The Gospel commanded them to cover, I am not the one who commanded them!

Foresight remains a point of view .. For we deal with realities, not illusions .. In the airports of the new era, "clothing regulations" DRESS CODE for women arriving from the world of moral decay! Will that happen? In my conception yes, and strongly, according to the texts I know. In the pictures: Western women at the airport of Bayt al-Maqdis adjusting their clothes! One of them thought she had to cover her face! And others get free clothes from inside the airport .. The virtuous state uses money for everything that builds virtue on its land, for it does not look at the world with the eye of trade.""")

t(2, 990, """Parliaments are either local and ethnic or have a wide, comprehensive vision resting on a moral basis .. Choosing a member of parliament on an ethnic basis raises moral questions about the absence of transparency and integrity .. The choice based on the candidate's reputation, abilities, history and what people testify of him through his clear, open life record is a choice for achievement, not for parliamentary chatter, and a choice that can be trusted to protect the voters' interests""")

t(2, 2360, """Question: Will the computer keep working if the internet disappears?
Answer: The computer can work without the internet, because people used the computer for decades before the internet. So its working is possible if electricity continues, and it will exist, Allah Most High willing. And if people need operating programs locally, they will find them available in every local market. A halt in the manufacture of computer parts is the most likely thing, so perhaps there will be no devices in the market to buy when other devices break down. Even so, at the practical level, the manufacturing base for computer devices is not a complicated base, if a part of this industry survives the great war.""")

t(3, 1395, """Let us have mercy on this language, which has fallen to the tail of the nations' languages in respect on earth, out of their spite toward it because their languages cannot reach its beauty .. But its haters among its enemies are not to be blamed .. "al-arḍ" (the earth), not "al-arẓ" .. By Allah, we listen to the ḍād being turned into ẓā' as if we were listening to a discordant sound .. as if we were listening to a sound that hurts the ear, without exaggeration or overstatement .. "al-arḍ" .. not "al-arẓ" .. "ḍifdaʿ" (frog) .. not "ẓifdaʿ" .. "ḍaraba" (he struck) .. not "ẓaraba" .. Have mercy on us, may Allah have mercy on you .. By Allah, the matter has become tiring and exhausting for the soul. "Adharbayjan" .. not "Adarbayjan" .. "dhurriyya" (offspring) .. not "durriyya"? Who is this Durriyya?""")

t(3, 1925, """The new skills for keeping up with the return to paper will seem strange to the young at first .. while technology unrelated to the internet remains, such as the 3D printer .. and the pre-internet means of communication that can be generalised, by the permission of Allah Most High .. The scene will seem hard to adapt to, but man has always been used to adapting""")

t(4, 810, """May Allah bring you all to these neighbourhoods in Jerusalem .. Perhaps that will be, and Allah knows best, in 2027 or 2028 or another year .. None knows the unseen but Allah Most High .. But, Allah Most High willing, that will be soon""")

t(4, 2105, """I am she who, if I weep, the world weeps with me .. I am she who, if my tears flow, the world finds no rest except an illusion it builds and believes .. I am weeping, and today the whole world weeps with me, but this world does not know the reason for its weeping, out of ignorance, or aversion and insolence! As for me, I know the reason for its weeping .. It is a wrath that descends on the earth when I weep or my two sisters weep .. Then people's minds are corrupted because their souls are corrupted .. and their hands are corrupted .. and their consciences sink .. and the fields of their meanings turn barren .. they become thorns stuck in their throats .. Then their security collapses and they moan in silence, until not one of them hears the voice of truth bleeding in his ears .. Because I am Jerusalem, and I do not sell love on the roads of East and West like many great cities .. I and my two sisters are not just any cities .. So let the world try my weeping further .. Perhaps my weeping will increase, but I will not weep alone .. Perhaps my sobbing is muffled .. but the world's weeping will echo across the horizons as a punishment and they will not be able to hide it .. It will be a scandal .. This world will taste every poverty and misery and will flounder where it is .. it will shake in its place .. having lost its awareness after losing its soul .. I am a punishment or a blessing .. So whoever thinks my state today is a blessing, let him look to the East and to the West .. The world is about to clash as it has never done before in history .. And every time the world tears my garment, its own garment will surely be torn .. And neither gold nor silver will avail it .. nor iron nor fire .. It will be torn until I put on my garment anew ..""")

t(5, 150, """Then I will not weep .. nor grieve .. nor sob .. nor cry for help .. Only then will the world put on its garment with me .. Either I rejoice so that the world rejoices, or the world will perish, and after its perishing I too will smile .. as is always my habit .. I will smile after its perishing, because I always inherit the oppressors""")

t(5, 1465, """Muslims have grown used to meeting one another in front of television screens .. specifically in front of the news bulletins .. watching one another's tragedies on the screens .. Here is a people groaning from hunger watching a people being struck by aircraft .. And a people slaughtered by the knife watches a people slaughtered by bullets .. And another people, displaced and shattered, watches a people whose blood has been shed by every newly devised method .. As for Jerusalem, it is the title of the end of all this .. There is never an end to this except through Jerusalem .. Without Jerusalem no pain will stop .. no tears will stop .. no oppression will vanish .. and the life of no human being on the face of the whole earth will be set right""")

t(6, 560, """Brothers and sisters who believe in the age of the horse, the camel and the sword in the years before the sign of the Smoke .. Here is the reality of the world in the coming world order .. In the non-virtuous cities people do not sleep .. their cafes work until a late hour of the night .. In the Ummah of the virtuous city, shops are closed an hour after the Isha prayer .. The Prophet, Allah's blessings and peace be upon him and his family, disliked talk after the Isha prayer .. So whoever is afflicted with sleeplessness, his home is more fitting for him .. Because sleeplessness is not a collective phenomenon, nor is it a work of solidarity in which people stand together!""")

t(8, 1960, """A post set aside for questions""")

t(8, 2265, """Because of the wars, and perhaps because of the great war .. in the future everyone will have to care for the victims who have lost their limbs""")

t(9, 1090, """Wherever rivers have flowed .. a new life has breathed, around which people gathered""")

t(9, 2330, """The outlying regions cannot live the same atmosphere as the centre, even if the residents are provided with the best means of a dignified life .. The outlying regions will remain without bustle .. while the centre will hold all the vital human weight""")

t(10, 1165, """History stays .. it goes nowhere .. And every great city of our Islamic world possesses its beautiful historical heritage .. But people need humane housing .. In our Islamic countries there are very many fine neighbourhoods .. But those countries also contain many, many, many neighbourhoods that deserve demolition and rebuilding because they do not meet the minimum standards of humane housing .. An inference about the future, as we have all grown used to here: to picture that future with its ten years, which, if it runs long, perhaps cannot bear demolition and building. These pictures come to share with you this inference about the future of our region .. For many people live in houses unfit for human life .. These cannot bear waiting long years for demolition, then the removal of millions of tons of rubble, then building .. So my inference two months ago in a post pictured, and Allah knows best, the shape of the region's future as infrastructure .. the good and excellent remaining, and the poor housed in cities built from scratch .. These pictures are to clarify that inference about new cities that need nothing but houses worthy of the residents, mosques worthy of the residents, shops, streets, infrastructure and schools worthy of the residents""")

t(11, 1580, """The end of the era of small children wandering the streets far from their homes""")

t(12, 370, """Here is the house of the Ishmaelites, and with them all tongues .. Turks, Kurds, Amazigh, Pashtuns, Romans and from every tongue .. People from Shem, from Ham and from Japheth magnify the Lord together in Jerusalem .. As for the lights, they go out and then are lit .. As for those on whom they were put out, they will not be the ones on whom they are lit!""")

t(15, 1610, """A day will come upon this Ummah when, if it speaks by its Lord's permission, it happens; if it decides by its Lord's power, it comes to pass; and if it wills by its Lord's will, it is fulfilled for it. On that day there are no glad tidings for those who made its children, its women and its elderly weep""")

t(16, 420, """1000 flights daily to the Islamic world .. If our Great Lord wills, He makes them 10 thousand""")

t(16, 1690, """Brothers and sisters who follow .. The burden has been lifted from you, for this channel is no longer an effort for which I am thanked, but a charge whose meaning and standing were settled in a vision tonight, shortly before the night prayer .. And one who is charged and told, by interpretation, "We provide for you and take care of you, so do not fall behind in your work" is not like one who chose .. But help me as much as you can by being patient with the delay in replies to private messages, for it is part of my work that I was forbidden to fall behind in. And whoever among those present has grasped something and can help a follower, man or woman, with an understanding that was hard for them, his deed is for Allah .. Whoever is charged is helped by Allah, his Great Lord. And part of the help of the Great Lord, hallowed be His names, is the goodness of companionship and fellowship, the good character of those one sits with, and the grasping of every hard thing among the choicest companions. For the help of Allah Most High has causes if He wills, and if He wills He makes it from Himself alone. This statement is only a trust to be conveyed, so that there is removed from me any concealment meant for ease and for shirking the responsibility of the channel, or any wish to show what is contrary to the truth in order to keep fatigue away. So whoever wishes to make things hard by demanding, asking and insisting, he may have what he wants. But I say: remember that you may be commanded with something you cannot do and are not helped in. And whoever wishes, let him be, by his Lord's permission, a help by which the circle is completed. For whoever seeks Allah arrives, and every road has its fatigue and its cost. As for this gathering, what is to come in it does not resemble what has passed, after tonight's vision, for it is the first to make clear that this gathering is for the Muslims, and therefore "We have sufficed you so that you advance in this gathering" .. And when I said to the symbol (destiny): I will return to the channel after one more day of rest, he said no, gently. And Allah is the One whose help is sought.""")

t(16, 2480, """The Islamic world .. no poverty .. no visas .. no fear .. no tears .. in spite of them .. by the power and will of our Lord, hallowed be His names""")

t(17, 1320, """(And We wish to bestow favour on those who were oppressed in the land, and to make them leaders and make them the inheritors)""")

t(17, 2555, """Much medical care will be needed for people after the exhausting, wearying world war""")

t(18, 2565, """By Allah and by Allah, it is surely true, just as they breathe and disbelieve""")

t(19, 1365, """Peace be upon you and the mercy of Allah and His blessings. The matter became confused for some of our brothers regarding tonight's post (on the conditions of the displaced), and they thought the cause of my anger was a personal matter .. The problem is not particular to me, it is about people .. The problem is in households and families in the east of the earth and in its west; if there are men among them who can endure, there are also women, children and old people. The servant in need of Allah Most High saw a vision at dawn today containing a clear command that anger or distress of soul must not be an obstacle keeping me from the channel. The vision had details, of which I mention a command from a stranger I do not know. But what I knew is that he is someone in charge, though in charge of what I do not know (he recurs with me as a symbol of destiny). So the one commanding is destiny, for he said that yesterday, when I withdrew, is enough, that I must not add to yesterday another day withdrawn from the channel, and that I must return to duty and work. This is the interpretation of what was said, in wording and in meaning.

Accordingly, the problem is not, was not and will not be particular to the servant in need of Allah Most High. The problem is pain for people. Pain for a child whose little heart beats with fear when he hears his parents whispering about displacement from one place to another; pain for an old man whose bones have grown brittle, whose sight has weakened and whose back is bent, as he hears his son and his son's wife whispering about displacement once again, and weeps because he can no longer walk any more; pain for an old woman advanced in years, everything in her grown old, hearing her daughter whisper with her husband about a new round of displacement on the earth! My anger was not for myself; I am only one person, who does not represent the pain of those from whom the simplest features of human life have been stripped. The animal has become safer than them, puppies have become safer than their children, and even the ants in their cracks are of greater worth than them on earth. For these I spoke yesterday, not for myself. For man is the one whom Allah Most High made heir to the earth; the ants and the animals did not inherit the earth, so that a cat somewhere in the world should have the right that no one tell her "move from your place", while a family on a street, on a pavement, in the east of the earth or its west is pursued and told "move, get out" .. and its members walk the streets looking around in fear .. Security is gone from them .. the basics of life are gone from them .. their children are filled with fear .. the women's spirits are shattered .. and the old wish for death; the old man says to his son: My son, bury me here .. And the old woman says to her son: My son, be patient, perhaps I will die and you bury me, then you, your wife and your children set off on your journey of displacement. For these I was angry when I remembered all this, not for a private problem.""")

t(20, 1200, """I do not like writing when I am angry, so I disappeared today for eight hours. One of the angriest days for the soul has passed. A great anger seethed in the soul, such as has rarely come over me. The earth's area, as is said, is 148.9 million km². Out of 148.9 million km², a person cannot find a single square kilometre to settle in without obstacles and hurdles that make him feel the 148.9 million km² have become for him zero km² .. Wherever you turn your face in these 148.9 million km², you will find every kind of law that wears you out, so that you remain suspended between heaven and earth.

As I write these words I feel for every .. every single Palestinian, Egyptian, Sudanese, Yemeni, Somali, Iraqi, Turkestani, Arakanese and others for whom the 148.9 million km² have become too narrow .. By Allah, entering the graves is easier than this life that people displaced from the countries of crisis are living .. The suffering of the displaced is not easy, yet people in the suffering countries think those who were displaced live in comfort! For the displaced, the 148.9 million km² have become too narrow .. 148.9 million square kilometres of dry land have become too narrow for them .. 148.9 million square kilometres of dry land .. And no one can live in the water .. and we cannot fly to the sky .. I returned home a short while ago, and I have never in my life seen the moon this size, nor have I ever seen it the colour of blood as I saw it tonight .. dripping blood, with no spot of white in it .. This earth has rotted .. and its smell has become foul as never before .. and the life of the people of the stricken countries on it has become a wretched, wretched life .. Even Allah's creatures are angry .. even the planets are angry .. This is a wretched life that people from the countries of crisis can no longer bear .. The 148.9 million square kilometres have narrowed on the stricken until they became like the neck of a bottle .. To those who watch what I publish on the channel every day I say: all that you see is little, by the power of Allah Most High, compared to what our Ummah, Allah willing, ought to do and carry out. For injustice has grown severe, swelled and overwhelmed people, and people have been hunted across the whole earth with no crime, no sin and no fault except that they belong to the stricken countries! A pursuit that millions face today, from country to country and from land to land, with no place for them to settle .. And if they do settle for a period of time, they are bombarded with laws and regulations and displaced anew.

People can no longer bear what is happening .. The displaced, in their millions, are no longer able to move from country to country without stop, without end and without solution, and the poor are no longer able to bear poverty and worry .. In 148.9 million kilometres, millions of people no longer have a foothold to set their feet on, nor a place where people sleep without fear of tomorrow .. So they are expelled and displaced once or twice every year .. These caravans of households, families and individuals: the caravan has barely rested from the hardship of the road when it is told, come on, get out of the place and leave .. Families in the hundreds of thousands across the wretched, miserable Islamic world, from Malaysia and Indonesia to the west of the earth, are hounded every day with residence permits, granted and cancelled, granted and cancelled .. and with strict, hard laws that families and households cannot bear, men, women and children. What is happening to hundreds of thousands of families and millions of individuals is worse than poverty .. worse than the poverty of the Palestinian, the Egyptian, the Algerian, the Tunisian, the Syrian, the Iraqi and others in his own country .. The displacement of millions of people weighs heavier than poverty .. The displaced is poor and displaced .. and the poor is poor and not displaced .. The poor man in his own country is not told: leave .. The displaced is poor and is told: leave .. This matter in human life is unprecedented; it has reached its limit and exceeded all reason, logic and mercy .. Mankind has entered a dangerous stage of one kind of injustice, whose price will be""")

t(21, 150, """very great .. The matter is no longer bearable .. And that homeland we were promised in the future of the world is true; by the power of the Compeller, the Avenger, the Most Merciful, it is coming.""")

t(21, 1620, """The end of the play and the return to reality""")
